# Local product-planning, architecture, and agent-control material
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/IMPLEMENTATION-OBJECTIVE.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/prds/
# NO EXCEPTIONS. This rule used to read `/prds/*` followed by
# `!/prds/local-actions/` and `!/prds/local-actions/**`, which re-included
# exactly one PRD set -- and eight internal planning documents were published
# on a public repository for it. A negation under an ignore rule is a decision
# to publish; there is no reason to make that decision here.
/architecture/
/governance/
/packaging/DISTRIBUTION-READINESS.md
/packaging/EXTERNAL-SETUP.md
/test/governance-requirement-traceability.test.mjs
/scripts/verify-repository-governance.mjs
/scripts/scaffolding-negative-controls.test.mjs
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.codex-work/
/audits/
/docs/internal/
/internal/
/plans/
/reviews/

# Cross-chat coordination mailbox — local only, never published
_buzon/
buzon/
